flowchart TB
    UI["Analyst Workbench<br/>Upload · Jobs · Findings · Packet / Flow Explorer"]
    API["API Gateway<br/>Authentication · Validation · Cases · Job status"]
    META[("Case metadata + audit log")]
    CAPTURE[("Private capture / artifact storage")]
    QUEUE["Bounded job queue<br/>Backpressure · explicit busy state"]
    WORKER["Isolated per-job worker<br/>CPU · RAM · time · packet caps"]
    PARSE["TShark + Zeek parsing<br/>Protocol logs · flow records"]
    DETECT["Deterministic detectors<br/>DNS · TLS · beacon · flow · YARA"]
    EVIDENCE[("Evidence store<br/>Packet refs · provenance · coverage")]
    REDACT["Evidence minimizer + redactor<br/>No raw PCAP / payload by default"]
    OSINT["Optional IOC enrichment<br/>Selected indicators · consent"]
    LLM["Optional LLM endpoint<br/>Local / private default · remote opt-in"]
    REPORT["Findings + report<br/>Confidence · evidence links · limitations"]

    UI -->|Upload request| API
    API -->|Validate type, size, quota; hash| CAPTURE
    API -->|Create case and job| META
    API -->|Queue job| QUEUE
    QUEUE --> WORKER
    WORKER -->|Read-only input · isolated output| CAPTURE
    WORKER --> PARSE
    PARSE --> DETECT
    DETECT -->|Findings + detector provenance| EVIDENCE
    DETECT -. IOC-only · optional .-> OSINT
    OSINT -. Provider result / status .-> EVIDENCE
    DETECT --> REDACT
    REDACT -. Sanitized structured context .-> LLM
    LLM -. Narrative cites existing evidence IDs .-> EVIDENCE
    META --> REPORT
    EVIDENCE --> REPORT
    REPORT --> UI
    API -->|Progress / terminal state| UI

    classDef optional fill:#30291b,stroke:#d9b45b,color:#f1dfad,stroke-dasharray:5 4;
    class OSINT,LLM optional;
